WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/system/components/InputCommandTile.tsx — a PURE presentational leaf rendered by the Vehicle
  Command Center for a `type:'input'` command. It is fed `def: CommandDef`, `loading`, `lastStatus`, `isFavorite`
  + the callbacks `onRequestDialog(def)` / `onToggleFavorite()`; it issues no HTTP. Composition:
    GlassPanel(p-4, min-h-[100px], centered, cursor-pointer, group, hover:border-neon-{tone}/30 by variant)
      → ghost favorite star (absolute top-left): amber-300 when favorite, else muted + group-hover reveal;
        aria-label t('commands.toggleFavorite','Toggle favorite'); stops click propagation.
      → icon box (rounded, bg surface-2, text-muted): <Loader2 spin/> when `loading`, else <def.icon/>.
      → label t(def.labelKey, def.labelFallback); optional sublabel t(def.sublabelKey, def.sublabelFallback).
      → optional lastStatus line: `startsWith('✓')` ⇒ neon-green/60, else neon-red/60.
      → onClick ⇒ onRequestDialog(def) (early-return while `loading`); `loading` ⇒ opacity-50.
  Data sources: `useTranslation` only (no data hooks). Shared components: @/components/ui (Button, GlassPanel).
  i18n key extracted from source: `commands.toggleFavorite` = "Toggle favorite" (the label/sublabel/lastStatus
  values are data, supplied by the parent's CommandDef + command-log).

