PARITY MAPPING (web → Apple platform tokens; no Tailwind ported)
  GlassPanel(p-4, min-h-100)   → .tsGlassPanel() modifier (Sources/Design/TSMaterial.swift) on a min-height-100,
                                 lg-padded tile inside a Button (whole-tile tap = web onClick).
  ghost favorite star          → plain SwiftUI Button + SF Symbol star/star.fill; Color.TS.statusWarning when
                                 favorite else Color.TS.textMuted; a11y label `commands.toggleFavorite`;
                                 sibling-in-ZStack (not nested) so its tap never fires the tile action.
  Loader2 spin / def.icon      → ProgressView while executing, else Image(systemName: def.systemImage) — the
                                 native counterpart of the web LucideIcon, carried on CommandTileDef.
  icon box (surface-2)         → Color.TS.textMuted.opacity(0.12) fill, RoundedRectangle TSRadius.md.
  lastStatus ✓/✗ (neon-green/60·neon-red/60) → CommandTileStatus.parse(startsWith '✓') + Color.TS.statusSuccess /
                                 Color.TS.statusDanger (the toned body-text mapping; no neon body text).
  variant hover border (neon cyan/red/green) → accent border faint at rest, brighter on press (hover-free):
                                 default → Color.TS.accent, danger → Color.TS.statusDanger,
                                 success → Color.TS.statusSuccess. CommandTileVariant.rawValue keeps "default".
  loading opacity-50           → the in-flight dim on the tile button style.
  FadeIn → TSFadeIn ; Skeleton → TSSkeleton ; retry → TSButton(.secondary,.small).
  i18n      : every string via the P1/S10 facade (InputCommandStrings, table "InputCommandTile"); zero English
              literals in code. Data-driven label/sublabel resolve via the same facade with the web fallback.
  a11y      : the tile button carries a combined label + an open/sending/offline hint; the star is a separate
              labeled element with .isSelected when favorite; the status line gets a spoken label (no ✓/✗ glyph
              read); the freshness chip is labeled; the icon is decorative. Dynamic Type + Reduce Motion via the
              shared tokens/components.
  telemetry : view.opened surface="InputCommandTile" via InputCommandTileModel.start (P1/S11), default OSLog sink.
  states    : loading (skeleton tile) / empty (friendly "command unavailable" tile, never blank) / error (parent
              query failure, retry) / data, plus the P4 leaf freshness axis live / stale (chip + one-shot
              auto-refresh) / offline (chip + disabled actuation — a command is a remote action). The web data
              sub-states (in-flight spinner+dim, favorite, ✓/✗ status) all render.

